        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINWINCOM, Single Cylinder Windsor Knob and Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIntricately detailed, the ornate Single Cylinder Windsor Knob and Deadbolt Combo features a fanciful design that is dripping with elegance. The beautiful embellishments of the Windsor Entry Set will surely add glamor to your home. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Windsor Entry Set with matching Windsor Knob fits doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. It is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-windsor-series\"><b>Windsor Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur WINWINCOM Single Cylinder Windsor Knob and Deadbolt Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Windsor Knob and Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Height: 8.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Width: 2.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Knob Diameter: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.20\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-plate.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-knob.pdf?v=1704262241\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
